{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーもー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"200更新まで残すところ\nあと1回(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきなりですが\n面白い顔文字見つけたっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( Д) ﾟﾟ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"驚いて目が外に\n飛び出ちゃってるの（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさていきなり\nお知らせですが、今発売中の\nAKB新聞に載せていただいてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/12/22/1322039/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"企画は釣り(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フィッシングです(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めての釣りでアジを\n釣っちゃいました〜(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーん♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/12/22/1322039/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アジさんなかなか手強い相手で\nズッキュンも効かず..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも最後はカルパッチョを作って\nぺろっと食べちゃいました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/12/22/1322039/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アジさんありがとう(○ -ω- ○)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々にお魚さばいたら\n家でも魚料理を作りたくなって\nちょいちょい作ってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"釣りスゴく難しかったけど\nやってみると結構ハマっちゃう☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひみなさんチェック\nお願いしますヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして明日は全握＠名古屋〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武道館ライブ後、一番近い\n握手会だからホヤホヤの\nライブの感想などなど\n聞くのも楽しみにしてるよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ来れなかった方も真夏に\n感想聞いたりしてください(人-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい話します♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回私とペアなのは..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エセ京都人こと樋口日奈〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってひなちまに「エセ」とか\n使うのはなんだか申し訳ない...（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(じゃあ言わなきゃいいじゃん。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、ひなちまとは初のペア！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回もひなでしたが\n今回はもう一人のひな(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ恒例の紹介time\n行きたいと思います♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまと初めてご対面の\nみなさまヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまはお散歩や\n食べることが好きで、\nエセ京都人の名にふさわしく\n抹茶好き(人-ω-)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(個人的に好きな食べ物は八つ橋で\nあってほしいなぁとか\n思っております...（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は何なのか気になった方は\nぜひ握手会で(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまは優しくて本当に\n女の子らしい子だから\nいろんな話を\n聞いてくれるはずヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと私、ひなちまのダンスが\n好きでよくチラ見してます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続いて真夏と初めましての\nみなさん(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の握手はアトラクションのように\n自由に楽しんでもらって大丈夫です♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏ってどんな子だ？と\n思っている方もぜひ一度\nお試しで来ちゃってください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでもリクエストOKです(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年末だしお仕事やお勉強で\n忙しい人も多いと思うので\n応援メッセージとかも\n考えとこうかなぁ(`･v･´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちま推しのみなさま\n明日は1日お世話になります(･v･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年最後の握手になる方も\nいると思うので明日は\nひなちまと真夏とみなさんで\nいっぱいぎゅ〜して\n楽しい1日にしましょ〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/12/22/1322039/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくたー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋で隣の席だったんだけど\n相変わらず今日もめんどくさい\nテンションだったよ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の乃木どこは\nキュンキュンしちゃう回だから\nみなさんお楽しみに(人-ω-)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録楽しかったなぁ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聖なる夜はメンバーと\n過ごしちゃお〜ヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/12/22/1322039/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type"